//Barba.npc

*E_NAME		"Barba"

*E_CHAT		"There's a way to protect your equipment in this chaotic time." 
*E_CHAT		"Imprinting on your equipment will decrease the risk of losing them."
*E_CHAT		"If you want to remove the imprint, you'll need a Brush of Oblivion."
*E_CHAT		"Imprinted items cannot be moved from your inventory to other's."